# Build output. `npm run build:week` pours data/ into artifact/template.html and
# writes this, and /courses runs that build immediately before publishing — so a
# committed copy is never the one that ships. It was tracked until 2026-09-15,
# where it differed from the template by two lines and doubled the diff of every
# commit that touched the page.
#
# This is not data/. Everything under data/ stays committed and public, which is
# Charlotte's decision — see the hard rules in CLAUDE.md.
artifact/week.html
